  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for tolerance-aware numeric assertions on System.Numerics types and BCL primitives. NaN-aware, infinity-aware, AOT-compatible. Covers MathTolerance (scalar / Vector2-4 / Quaternion + rotational equivalence / Matrix4x4 / Plane + geometric equivalence / Complex / ReadOnlySpan and ReadOnlyTensorSpan / ULP-distance / relative+absolute combined), Sequences (monotonicity / boundedness / progressions / convergence), Statistics (Welford's mean+variance / median / percentile / sigma bounds), LinearAlgebra (matrix invariants and vector pair properties), NumberTheory (long-integer predicates), and Geometry3D (eight primitive types with property predicates / containment / closest-point distance / intersection / pointcloud aggregates). Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages, starting with MathAssertions.TUnit.",
  "id": "MathAssertions",
